{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" initial=\"a\">\n  <final id=\"a\">\n    <onentry><log label=\"R&D;\"/></onentry>\n  </final>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/xml003-unknown-entity.scxml"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":1,"notes":0,"total":1,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/xml003-unknown-entity.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":1,"byteOffset":117,"endColumn":28,"endLine":3,"startColumn":27,"startLine":3},"insertedContent":{"text":"&amp;"}}]}],"description":{"text":"escape the ampersand"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/xml003-unknown-entity.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":30,"endLine":3,"startColumn":27,"startLine":3}}}],"message":{"markdown":"undefined entity reference `&D;`\n\n**Note:** XML predefines only `&lt;`, `&gt;`, `&amp;`, `&apos;`, and `&quot;`; any other entity must be declared in the document's internal DTD subset\n\n**Help:** if a literal ampersand was intended, escape it as `&amp;`; otherwise use a numeric character reference such as `&#169;`\n\n**Spec:** XML 1.0 (Fifth Edition) §4.6 Predefined Entities","text":"undefined entity reference `&D;`"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":120,"start":117},"category":"syntax"},"ruleId":"XML003"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"XML predefines only `&lt;`, `&gt;`, `&amp;`, `&apos;`, and `&quot;`; any other entity must be declared in the document's internal DTD subset (XML 1.0 §4.1 WFC: Entity Declared)"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: write the character as a numeric reference such as `&#160;`, or escape a literal ampersand as `&amp;`.\n\nSpecification: XML 1.0 (Fifth Edition) §4.6 Predefined Entities\n\nRun `scxml-cli --explain XML003` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/xml/#sec-predefined-ent","id":"XML003","name":"XML003","properties":{"category":"syntax"},"shortDescription":{"text":"an entity reference names no predefined or declared entity"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}